# Build context is apps/: send only sources, never local build output, dependencies or secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.gradle
**/bin
**/out
agent/
desktop/
# Secrets that .gitignore keeps out of Git but a build context would still carry
# (Docker reads only this file, not .gitignore). check-build-context.ps1 plants synthetic
# files and shows which of them a build would receive; run it after changing this file.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/.npmrc
